So in this particular case, the issue is that the constant.subspan is being processed twice. Once as an output buffer and once because of the special hardcoded logic for handling constant.subspan ops (https://github.com/google/iree/blob/07bfdd4c8162d12ec2caf6946c7a1b7156569744/iree/compiler/Dialect/HAL/Conversion/FlowToHAL/ConvertStreamOps.cpp#L550). I assume that the assumption is that a stream returning a constant shouldn't have been formed at all. This particular stream wasn't originally that though, it was more like

```mlir
func main() -> tensor<4x8x11x2xf32> {
    %0 = flow.ex.stream.fragment(%arg65, %arg4, %arg3, %arg14) : (tensor<33708x7xf32>, tensor<7xf32>, tensor<7xf32>, tensor<7x22xf32>) -> tensor<4x8x11x2xf32> = (%arg66: tensor<33708x7xf32>, %arg67: tensor<7xf32>, %arg68: tensor<7xf32>, %arg69: tensor<7x22xf32>) -> tensor<4x8x11x2xf32> {
      %const_span = hal.constant.subspan @_const_pool_splats[#hal.byte_range<16, 2816>] : tensor<4x8x11x2xf32>
	  // many dispatches ...
      %23 = flow.tensor.reshape %22 : tensor<4x22xf32> -> tensor<4x1x11x2xf32>
      %24 = flow.tensor.update %23, %const_span[%c0, %c0, %c0, %c0] : tensor<4x1x11x2xf32> -> tensor<4x8x11x2xf32>
      flow.return %24 : tensor<4x8x11x2xf32>
  }
  return %0 : tensor<4x8x11x2xf32>
}
```

This stream processing code really makes too many assumptions that aren't even properly checked by preconditions and just randomly assert somewhere.

issue.body:
The following reproducer (extracted from a large model) results in an assert failure while running  `allocateTransientBuffers`: https://github.com/google/iree/blob/07bfdd4c8162d12ec2caf6946c7a1b7156569744/iree/compiler/Dialect/HAL/Conversion/FlowToHAL/ConvertStreamOps.cpp#L366-L367


because the constant subspan op is mapped to multiple buffers.

```mlir
// configuration: -pass-pipeline='iree-convert-to-hal'

func @main() {
  %0 = flow.ex.stream.fragment() : () -> tensor<4x8x11x2xf32> =
      () -> tensor<4x8x11x2xf32> {
    %const_span = hal.constant.subspan @_const_pool_splats[#hal.byte_range<16, 2816>] : tensor<4x8x11x2xf32>
    flow.return %const_span : tensor<4x8x11x2xf32>
  }
  return
}
```

